 "remarks": "A LOCATION THAT CAN'T BE BEAT!  Set on a beautiful 1-acre lot in the highly desirable Westover area, this property is nicely set back from Roxbury Road, offering a wonderful opportunity to customize, refresh or expand and make it your own!  The home features an attached 2-car garage, plus bonus space adjacent to the garage complete with a wood-burning stove, full bath with walk-in shower, and walk-out access to the patio and backyard. A convenient half bath for guests is located near the front entrance.  Up a flight of stairs, you'll find a light-filled living room with vaulted ceilings and a wood-burning fireplace, flowing into a formal dining room with access to a wood deck as well as an eat-in kitchen. The upper level offers three bedrooms and a full bath.  The basement provides utilities, multiple storage areas (including former kitchen cabinetry), and a workbench/shop area.  The possibilities are endless! Whether you're an investor, contractor or buyer looking to create something special, this is an opportunity you won't want to miss in a prime Westover location.  Run, don't walk!",
